{"seq":3,"slug":"web-backend","title":"Web 后端 Actix/Axum","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ecosystem/web-backend","wordCount":617,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"web-后端-actix-axum\">Web 后端 Actix/Axum</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Rust 的 Web 后端建立在 Tokio 异步运行时之上，其竞争力来自<strong>高吞吐下的可预测资源占用</strong>——没有 GC 停顿，尾延迟更稳定。理解本篇的关键，是把框架的差异归结到一个设计选择：中间件的抽象方式，由此引出 Axum 的 Tower 体系与 Actix Web 的自有模型两条路线。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;HTTP 请求&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;路由 Router&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;中间件层&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;类型提取 Extractor&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;处理函数 Handler&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;响应 Response&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"HTTP 请求\"] --&gt; B[\"路由 Router\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"中间件层\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"类型提取 Extractor\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"处理函数 Handler\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"响应 Response\"]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Axum 复用 Tower 生态</strong>：中间件可跨框架与客户端共享，抽象统一但需要理解 <code>Service</code> 概念。</li>\n<li><strong>Actix Web 自成体系</strong>：基于 Actor 模型，路由宏较多，成熟稳定且历史悠久。</li>\n<li><strong>共享状态经 <code>State</code> 注入</strong>：处理函数通过提取器获取连接池、配置等依赖，类型在编译期检查。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"rust-web-后端生态\">Rust Web 后端生态</h2><p>Rust 的 Web 后端框架基于 Tokio 异步运行时，在性能和资源效率上具有显著优势。两大主流框架是 Axum（由 Tokio 团队维护）和 Actix Web。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>维护者</th>\n<th>架构特点</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Axum</td>\n<td>Tokio 团队</td>\n<td>Tower 中间件体系</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Actix Web</td>\n<td>社区</td>\n<td>Actor 模型</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rocket</td>\n<td>社区</td>\n<td>宏驱动</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Poem</td>\n<td>社区</td>\n<td>轻量级</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"axum-快速入门\">Axum 快速入门</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use axum::{&#10;    extract::{Path, Query, State},&#10;    http::StatusCode,&#10;    response::Json,&#10;    routing::{get, post},&#10;    Router,&#10;};&#10;use serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};&#10;use std::sync::Arc;&#10;use tokio::sync::Mutex;&#10;&#10;#[derive(Clone)]&#10;struct AppState {&#10;    db: Arc&lt;Mutex&lt;Vec&lt;User&gt;&gt;&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[derive(Serialize, Deserialize, Clone)]&#10;struct User {&#10;    id: u64,&#10;    name: String,&#10;    email: String,&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[derive(Deserialize)]&#10;struct CreateUser {&#10;    name: String,&#10;    email: String,&#10;}&#10;&#10;async fn list_users(State(state): State&lt;AppState&gt;) -&gt; Json&lt;Vec&lt;User&gt;&gt; {&#10;    let users = state.db.lock().await;&#10;    Json(users.clone())&#10;}&#10;&#10;async fn create_user(&#10;    State(state): State&lt;AppState&gt;,&#10;    Json(payload): Json&lt;CreateUser&gt;,&#10;) -&gt; (StatusCode, Json&lt;User&gt;) {&#10;    let mut users = state.db.lock().await;&#10;    let user = User {&#10;        id: users.len() as u64 + 1,&#10;        name: payload.name,&#10;        email: payload.email,&#10;    };&#10;    users.push(user.clone());&#10;    (StatusCode::CREATED, Json(user))&#10;}&#10;&#10;async fn get_user(&#10;    State(state): State&lt;AppState&gt;,&#10;    Path(id): Path&lt;u64&gt;,&#10;) -&gt; Result&lt;Json&lt;User&gt;, StatusCode&gt; {&#10;    let users = state.db.lock().await;&#10;    users&#10;        .iter()&#10;        .find(|u| u.id == id)&#10;        .cloned()&#10;        .map(Json)&#10;        .ok_or(StatusCode::NOT_FOUND)&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[tokio::main]&#10;async fn main() {&#10;    let state = AppState {&#10;        db: Arc::new(Mutex::new(vec![])),&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    let app = Router::new()&#10;        .route(&quot;/users&quot;, get(list_users).post(create_user))&#10;        .route(&quot;/users/{id}&quot;, get(get_user))&#10;        .with_state(state);&#10;&#10;    let listener = tokio::net::TcpListener::bind(&quot;0.0.0.0:3000&quot;)&#10;        .await&#10;        .unwrap();&#10;    axum::serve(listener, app).await.unwrap();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use axum::{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    extract::{Path, Query, State},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    http::StatusCode,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    response::Json,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    routing::{get, post},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Router,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::Arc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio::sync::Mutex;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Clone)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct AppState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    db: Arc&#x3C;Mutex&#x3C;Vec&#x3C;User>>>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Serialize, Deserialize, Clone)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id: u64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    email: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Deserialize)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct CreateUser {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    email: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn list_users(State(state): State&#x3C;AppState>) -> Json&#x3C;Vec&#x3C;User>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let users = state.db.lock().await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Json(users.clone())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn create_user(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    State(state): State&#x3C;AppState>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Json(payload): Json&#x3C;CreateUser>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) -> (StatusCode, Json&#x3C;User>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut users = state.db.lock().await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let user = User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        id: users.len() as u64 + 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        name: payload.name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        email: payload.email,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    users.push(user.clone());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (StatusCode::CREATED, Json(user))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn get_user(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    State(state): State&#x3C;AppState>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Path(id): Path&#x3C;u64>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) -> Result&#x3C;Json&#x3C;User>, StatusCode> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let users = state.db.lock().await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .iter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .find(|u| u.id == id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .cloned()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map(Json)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .ok_or(StatusCode::NOT_FOUND)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[tokio::main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let state = AppState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        db: Arc::new(Mutex::new(vec![])),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let app = Router::new()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .route(\"/users\", get(list_users).post(create_user))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .route(\"/users/{id}\", get(get_user))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with_state(state);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let listener = tokio::net::TcpListener::bind(\"0.0.0.0:3000\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    axum::serve(listener, app).await.unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"中间件与-tower\">中间件与 Tower</h2><p>Axum 基于 Tower 中间件体系，可以组合复用各种中间件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use axum::{middleware, Router, routing::get, http::Request, response::Response};&#10;use std::time::Instant;&#10;use tower_http::cors::{CorsLayer, Any};&#10;use tower_http::trace::TraceLayer;&#10;&#10;async fn logging_middleware(&#10;    req: Request&lt;axum::body::Body&gt;,&#10;    next: middleware::Next,&#10;) -&gt; Response {&#10;    let method = req.method().clone();&#10;    let uri = req.uri().clone();&#10;    let start = Instant::now();&#10;&#10;    let response = next.run(req).await;&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;{} {} - {:?} - {}&quot;,&#10;        method, uri, start.elapsed(), response.status());&#10;    response&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn create_app() -&gt; Router {&#10;    Router::new()&#10;        .route(&quot;/&quot;, get(|| async { &quot;Hello, World!&quot; }))&#10;        .layer(middleware::from_fn(logging_middleware))&#10;        .layer(CorsLayer::new().allow_origin(Any))&#10;        .layer(TraceLayer::new_for_http())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use axum::{middleware, Router, routing::get, http::Request, response::Response};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::time::Instant;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use tower_http::cors::{CorsLayer, Any};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use tower_http::trace::TraceLayer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn logging_middleware(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    req: Request&#x3C;axum::body::Body>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    next: middleware::Next,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) -> Response {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let method = req.method().clone();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let uri = req.uri().clone();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let start = Instant::now();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let response = next.run(req).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{} {} - {:?} - {}\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        method, uri, start.elapsed(), response.status());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    response</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn create_app() -> Router {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Router::new()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .route(\"/\", get(|| async { \"Hello, World!\" }))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .layer(middleware::from_fn(logging_middleware))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .layer(CorsLayer::new().allow_origin(Any))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .layer(TraceLayer::new_for_http())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"数据库集成-sqlx\">数据库集成（SQLx）</h2><p><code>sqlx</code> 提供编译期验证的异步 SQL 查询。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use sqlx::postgres::PgPoolOptions;&#10;&#10;#[derive(sqlx::FromRow, serde::Serialize)]&#10;struct User {&#10;    id: i64,&#10;    name: String,&#10;    email: String,&#10;}&#10;&#10;async fn setup_db() -&gt; sqlx::PgPool {&#10;    PgPoolOptions::new()&#10;        .max_connections(5)&#10;        .connect(&quot;postgres://localhost/mydb&quot;)&#10;        .await&#10;        .expect(&quot;数据库连接失败&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;async fn find_user(pool: &amp;sqlx::PgPool, id: i64) -&gt; Result&lt;User, sqlx::Error&gt; {&#10;    sqlx::query_as::&lt;_, User&gt;(&quot;SELECT id, name, email FROM users WHERE id = $1&quot;)&#10;        .bind(id)&#10;        .fetch_one(pool)&#10;        .await&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use sqlx::postgres::PgPoolOptions;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(sqlx::FromRow, serde::Serialize)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id: i64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    email: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn setup_db() -> sqlx::PgPool {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    PgPoolOptions::new()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .max_connections(5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .connect(\"postgres://localhost/mydb\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .expect(\"数据库连接失败\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn find_user(pool: &#x26;sqlx::PgPool, id: i64) -> Result&#x3C;User, sqlx::Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sqlx::query_as::&#x3C;_, User>(\"SELECT id, name, email FROM users WHERE id = $1\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .bind(id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .fetch_one(pool)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"actix-web-示例\">Actix Web 示例</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use actix_web::{web, App, HttpServer, HttpResponse, Responder};&#10;use serde::Deserialize;&#10;&#10;#[derive(Deserialize)]&#10;struct Info {&#10;    name: String,&#10;}&#10;&#10;async fn greet(info: web::Query&lt;Info&gt;) -&gt; impl Responder {&#10;    HttpResponse::Ok().body(format!(&quot;你好, {}!&quot;, info.name))&#10;}&#10;&#10;async fn health() -&gt; impl Responder {&#10;    HttpResponse::Ok().json(serde_json::json!({&#10;        &quot;status&quot;: &quot;ok&quot;&#10;    }))&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[actix_web::main]&#10;async fn main() -&gt; std::io::Result&lt;()&gt; {&#10;    HttpServer::new(|| {&#10;        App::new()&#10;            .route(&quot;/greet&quot;, web::get().to(greet))&#10;            .route(&quot;/health&quot;, web::get().to(health))&#10;    })&#10;    .bind(&quot;0.0.0.0:8080&quot;)?&#10;    .run()&#10;    .await&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use actix_web::{web, App, HttpServer, HttpResponse, Responder};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use serde::Deserialize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Deserialize)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Info {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn greet(info: web::Query&#x3C;Info>) -> impl Responder {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    HttpResponse::Ok().body(format!(\"你好, {}!\", info.name))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn health() -> impl Responder {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    HttpResponse::Ok().json(serde_json::json!({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"status\": \"ok\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[actix_web::main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn main() -> std::io::Result&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    HttpServer::new(|| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        App::new()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .route(\"/greet\", web::get().to(greet))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .route(\"/health\", web::get().to(health))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .bind(\"0.0.0.0:8080\")?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .run()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"axum-vs-actix-web-对比\">Axum vs Actix Web 对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Axum</th>\n<th>Actix Web</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>异步运行时</td>\n<td>Tokio</td>\n<td>Actix（基于 Tokio）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间件体系</td>\n<td>Tower（生态复用）</td>\n<td>自有中间件系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型提取</td>\n<td>编译期类型安全</td>\n<td>编译期类型安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宏使用</td>\n<td>最少</td>\n<td>较多（路由宏）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WebSocket</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区趋势</td>\n<td>快速增长</td>\n<td>成熟稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"项目结构建议\">项目结构建议</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"my-web-app/&#10;├── Cargo.toml&#10;├── src/&#10;│   ├── main.rs&#10;│   ├── routes/&#10;│   │   ├── mod.rs&#10;│   │   ├── users.rs&#10;│   │   └── health.rs&#10;│   ├── models/&#10;│   │   ├── mod.rs&#10;│   │   └── user.rs&#10;│   ├── services/&#10;│   │   ├── mod.rs&#10;│   │   └── user_service.rs&#10;│   ├── middleware/&#10;│   │   └── auth.rs&#10;│   ├── error.rs&#10;│   └── config.rs&#10;├── migrations/&#10;└── tests/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>my-web-app/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── main.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── routes/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── mod.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── users.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── health.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── models/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── mod.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── user.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── services/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── mod.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── user_service.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── middleware/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── auth.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── error.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── config.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── migrations/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── tests/</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"常用-web-生态-crate\">常用 Web 生态 Crate</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Crate</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>tower-http</code></td>\n<td>通用 HTTP 中间件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sqlx</code></td>\n<td>异步数据库驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>serde</code> + <code>serde_json</code></td>\n<td>序列化/反序列化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jsonwebtoken</code></td>\n<td>JWT 认证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tracing</code></td>\n<td>结构化日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>validator</code></td>\n<td>请求数据验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>utoipa</code></td>\n<td>OpenAPI 文档生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reqwest</code></td>\n<td>HTTP 客户端</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Rust Web 后端基于 Tokio 异步运行时，在高吞吐下具有更稳定的尾延迟与更低的内存占用。</li>\n<li>Axum 由 Tokio 团队维护，复用 Tower 中间件生态；Actix Web 基于 Actor 模型，成熟稳定。</li>\n<li>提取器（<code>Path</code>/<code>Query</code>/<code>Json</code>/<code>State</code>）把请求解析与依赖注入统一为编译期类型检查。</li>\n<li><code>sqlx</code> 提供编译期验证的异步查询，<code>tower-http</code> 补齐 CORS、追踪等通用 HTTP 中间件。</li>\n<li>项目通常按 <code>routes</code>/<code>models</code>/<code>services</code>/<code>middleware</code> 分层，配合 <code>migrations</code> 与 <code>tests</code> 组织。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Web 后端 Actix/Axum","id":"web-后端-actix-axum"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Rust Web 后端生态","id":"rust-web-后端生态"},{"level":2,"text":"Axum 快速入门","id":"axum-快速入门"},{"level":2,"text":"中间件与 Tower","id":"中间件与-tower"},{"level":2,"text":"数据库集成（SQLx）","id":"数据库集成-sqlx"},{"level":2,"text":"Actix Web 示例","id":"actix-web-示例"},{"level":2,"text":"Axum vs Actix Web 对比","id":"axum-vs-actix-web-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"项目结构建议","id":"项目结构建议"},{"level":2,"text":"常用 Web 生态 Crate","id":"常用-web-生态-crate"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"WebAssembly 与 Rust","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ecosystem/wasm"},"next":{"title":"CLI 工具开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ecosystem/cli-tools"}}